Subject: [PATCH] game/acnh: the companion band, and that it is not yet seen on
 a device

The note's portrait section now names the companion its band holds, and a new
subsection records what fills it, how the profile opts in (companion.json,
the bundled manifest and build rows, companion.mk's sources), how the module
reads the guest and what it writes, the save snapshot a pocket move leaves,
and that none of it has run on a device yet: the pins against a player's
build, the 1240x1080 canvas in a 390x566 band and the pad over the panel.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: The ACNH companion: Eden Duo's reader and the band a phone standing up shows it in; nxnative carries it on feat/acnh-companion
Issue: none yet: no upstream issue for the companion

